1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,200
How could this happen?

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,300
Getter Rays drove us underground.

3
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,900
Humans, evolved by Getter Rays,

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,800
stole the surface from us.

5
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:14,550
And now Getter Robo, powered by those same
rays, will kill me!

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,150
Why?!

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,900
Why did the Getter Rays choose humanity and
turn against us?!

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,400
Is our ambition, our wish to reclaim the surface,

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:29,400
something we have no right to desire?!

10
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:33,550
Go on! Kill me! Do it!

11
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,650
Then allow me to oblige.

12
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:46,800
Wh-Who are you?!

13
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:52,900
A pleasure to meet you.

14
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,300
My name is Burai.

15
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:58,700
Emperor Burai of the Hyakki Empire.

16
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,500
The Hyakki Empire?!

17
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,900
Emperor Burai?!

18
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,300
They just keep coming!

19
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:08,300
I was waiting for you and those reptiles to kill
each other.

20
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,700
What a useless lot.

21
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:15,100
Still, I shall settle for being rid of those
troublesome lizards.

22
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:18,000
We shall meet again.

23
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,150
Do try to stay alive until then.

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,750
The Hyakki Empire...

25
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:29,000
Emperor Burai...
